/-! # The ideal generated by a map into an algebra sheaf

Source: Stacks Project, Properties, Tag 05JS, proof of
`lemma-algebra-directed-colimit-finite-presentation`; Sheaves, Tags 007Z, 0085, 0089;
Modules, Section 01AF; Modules on Sites, Section 03EK.
